      "problem": "Which of the following equations has no solutions for ${0}^{∘}\\le x<{360}^{∘}?$\n\nI. $\\operatorname{sec}⁡x=0$ $$\n\nII. $\\operatorname{sec}⁡x=8$\n\nIII. $\\operatorname{sec}⁡x=\\frac{7}{3}$",
