      "reasoning": "Both earlier answers are confirmed by their respective captured worked solutions. For real x where secant is defined, sec x=1/cos x has range (-∞,-1]∪[1,∞). For q-76503, sec x=0 is impossible, while sec x=8 and sec x=7/3 correspond to attainable cosine values 1/8 and 3/7; thus I only. For q-29163, sec x=1 has solution x=0, and sec x=2 has solutions π/3 and 5π/3, while sec x=1/2 would require cos x=2; thus III only. No source-answer disagreement occurs.",
